  {
   "speaker": "ravi",
   "text": "X dominates Y if every path from the entry to Y passes through X.",
   "visuals": []
  },
  {
   "speaker": "ravi",
   "text": "So which block is D's closest dominator? B, C, or A?",
   "visuals": []
  },
  {
   "speaker": "priya",
   "text": "B. It feeds D directly.",
   "visuals": []
  },
  {
   "speaker": "ravi",
   "text": "Ask the analyzer for the dominator tree.",
   "visuals": [
    {
     "do": "world.set",
     "world": "term.session",
     "cwd": "~/dom",
     "prompt": "{cwd} %",
     "title": "zsh: ~/dom"
    },
    {
     "do": "term.highlight",
     "off": true
    },
    {
     "do": "term.clear"
